    "indexText": "Park: Established as a national military park July 3, 1926; transferred from War Dept. Aug. 10, 1933; redesignated a national battlefield Aug. 24, 1962. Boundary changes: June 5, 1942; Sept. 7, 1949; Aug. 24, 1962; April 11, 1972; Nov. 10, 1978; December 26, 1990. Cemetery: Probable date of Civil War interments 1866. Transferred from War Dept. Aug. 10, 1933. Park acreage—2,739.72 Federal: 2,657.43 Nonfederal: 82.29. Cemetery acreage—8.72, all Federal."
